\[S = \sum_{k=1}^{1728} \frac{\omega^k - 1}{\omega^{4k} - 1} = \sum_{k=1}^{1728} \frac{\omega^k - 1}{(\omega^4)^k - 1} = \sum_{k=1}^{1728} \frac{\omega^k - 1}{(\omega^4 - 1) ((\omega^4)^{k-1} + (\omega^4)^{k-2} + \dots + \omega^4 + 1)} \]
