Let the given equation be
$$ \sin 3 \theta = \cos 7 \theta $$
Since $\sin x = \cos(90^\circ - x)$, we have
$$ \cos(90^\circ - 3 \theta) = \cos 7 \theta $$
Therefore,
$$ 90^\circ - 3 \theta = 7 \theta + 360^\circ k $$
or
$$ 90^\circ - 3 \theta = -7 \theta + 360^\circ k $$
for some integer $k$.

Case 1: $90^\circ - 3 \theta = 7 \theta + 360^\circ k$
$$ 90^\circ - 360^\circ k = 10 \theta $$
$$ \theta = \frac{90^\circ - 360^\circ k}{10} = 9^\circ - 36^\circ k $$
We want the smallest positive angle $\theta$, so we choose $k$ such that $9^\circ - 36^\circ k > 0$.
$9 > 36k$, so $k < \frac{9}{36} = \frac{1}{4} = 0.25$.
The largest integer $k$ satisfying this inequality is $k = 0$.
Hence $\theta = 9^\circ - 36(0) = 9^\circ$.

Case 2: $90^\circ - 3 \theta = -7 \theta + 360^\circ k$
$$ 90^\circ - 360^\circ k = -4 \theta $$
$$ \theta = \frac{90^\circ - 360^\circ k}{-4} = \frac{90^\circ}{-4} + \frac{360^\circ k}{4} = -22.5^\circ + 90^\circ k $$
We want the smallest positive angle $\theta$, so we choose $k$ such that $-22.5^\circ + 90^\circ k > 0$.
$90^\circ k > 22.5^\circ$, so $k > \frac{22.5^\circ}{90^\circ} = \frac{22.5}{90} = \frac{225}{900} = \frac{45}{180} = \frac{1}{4} = 0.25$.
The smallest integer $k$ satisfying this inequality is $k = 1$.
Hence $\theta = -22.5^\circ + 90^\circ (1) = 67.5^\circ$.

Thus the two possible values of $\theta$ are $9^\circ$ and $67.5^\circ$.
The smallest positive angle is $\theta = 9^\circ$.

Also, we can use $\sin x = \cos(90^\circ - x)$, so $\sin 3 \theta = \cos(90^\circ - 3 \theta)$.
Thus $\cos(90^\circ - 3 \theta) = \cos 7 \theta$.
We have $90^\circ - 3 \theta = 7 \theta + 360^\circ k$ or $90^\circ - 3 \theta = -7 \theta + 360^\circ k$.

Case 1: $90^\circ - 3 \theta = 7 \theta + 360^\circ k$
$90^\circ - 360^\circ k = 10 \theta$
$\theta = \frac{90 - 360k}{10} = 9 - 36k$
For $k=0$, $\theta = 9^\circ$.

Case 2: $90^\circ - 3 \theta = -7 \theta + 360^\circ k$
$4 \theta = 360^\circ k - 90^\circ$
$\theta = \frac{360k - 90}{4} = 90k - 22.5^\circ$
For $k=1$, $\theta = 90 - 22.5 = 67.5^\circ$.

The smallest positive angle is $9^\circ$.

